    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/7a1f5fdc0490f70644947425a1d3f3ea.avif?t=1743477068\" width=676 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a <strong>Peggle</strong> player, a<strong> cozy</strong> gamer, or a supporter of all things <strong>indie</strong>, you won't be able to put it down.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the non-stop, ball-bouncing fun of Pachinko mixed with the cozy and satisfying gameplay of farming sims like <strong>Stardew Valley</strong> and <strong>Harvest Moon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/6bc711e1ec10c5b58177e12bfb21d2cd.avif?t=1743477068\" width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.poster.avif?t=1743477068\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.webm?t=1743477068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.mp4?t=1743477068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear out space and collect materials with your <strong>pinball cannon</strong>. Watering your plants? Use your cannon for that! Taking care of animals? Your cannon does that too! Your fluffy friends love to bounce around that cannonball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of the day by lining up those<strong> trick shot</strong> ricochets. Then <strong>aim and fire</strong> your ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/00c333d121381c1d0fd1d9dae710e814.avif?t=1743477068\" width=800 height=411 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bountiful! This small town is vibrant and alive, and there are <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel! After a long day of farming call in a little favor with the carpenter or the blacksmith\u2014 now you can\u00a0stop by the <strong>sawmill</strong> or delve into the <strong>mines</strong> to mix things up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/f952ec0c074a83063eef1b8240137ee6.avif?t=1743477068\" width=696 height=419 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have arrived as hired help, but as you get to know your new small town, you'll find you're a perfect fit here. Bountiful townsfolk are full of personality, see who you connect with as you become one of the townsfolk too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >v<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/c5dcedbf6360930ecad233613e17ef4c.poster.avif?t=1743477068\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/c5dcedbf6360930ecad233613e17ef4c.webp?t=1743477068\" class=\"bb_img\" width=612 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/7a1f5fdc0490f70644947425a1d3f3ea.avif?t=1743477068\" width=676 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a <strong>Peggle</strong> player, a<strong> cozy</strong> gamer, or a supporter of all things <strong>indie</strong>, you won't be able to put it down.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the non-stop, ball-bouncing fun of Pachinko mixed with the cozy and satisfying gameplay of farming sims like <strong>Stardew Valley</strong> and <strong>Harvest Moon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/6bc711e1ec10c5b58177e12bfb21d2cd.avif?t=1743477068\" width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.poster.avif?t=1743477068\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.webm?t=1743477068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/82255011f79f8bddcc19baf9012c3348.mp4?t=1743477068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear out space and collect materials with your <strong>pinball cannon</strong>. Watering your plants? Use your cannon for that! Taking care of animals? Your cannon does that too! Your fluffy friends love to bounce around that cannonball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of the day by lining up those<strong> trick shot</strong> ricochets. Then <strong>aim and fire</strong> your ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/00c333d121381c1d0fd1d9dae710e814.avif?t=1743477068\" width=800 height=411 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bountiful! This small town is vibrant and alive, and there are <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel! After a long day of farming call in a little favor with the carpenter or the blacksmith\u2014 now you can\u00a0stop by the <strong>sawmill</strong> or delve into the <strong>mines</strong> to mix things up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/f952ec0c074a83063eef1b8240137ee6.avif?t=1743477068\" width=696 height=419 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have arrived as hired help, but as you get to know your new small town, you'll find you're a perfect fit here. Bountiful townsfolk are full of personality, see who you connect with as you become one of the townsfolk too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >v<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/c5dcedbf6360930ecad233613e17ef4c.poster.avif?t=1743477068\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/c5dcedbf6360930ecad233613e17ef4c.webp?t=1743477068\" class=\"bb_img\" width=612 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
